781990692049031\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@Darkfost_Coc</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Oct 26</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/Darkfost_Coc/status/2114781990692049031\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li><li class=\"xp-item\"><a class=\"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/Darkfost_Coc/status/2114006217135657392\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @Darkfost_Coc\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2114006217135657392.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig neg\">Bearish</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">on-chain</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">Long-term holders hold about 15.6 million BTC.</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/Darkfost_Coc/status/2114006217135657392\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@Darkfost_Coc</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Oct 24</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/Darkfost_Coc/status/2114006217135657392\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li><li class=\"xp-item\"><a class=\"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/AxelAdlerJr/status/2113900610533597336\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @AxelAdlerJr\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2113900610533597336.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig warn\">Neutral</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">on-chain</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\"><abbr class=\"gl\" title=\"Market value vs. realized value: price compared with the average cost basis of all coins. Above 1 = holders in profit on average.\" tabindex=\"0\">MVRV</abbr> Percentile recovered from 0% in July to 32% in late September, failed to hold 30-32% and slipped back to 25%.</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/AxelAdlerJr/status/2113900610533597336\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@AxelAdlerJr</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Oct 24</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/AxelAdlerJr/status/2113900610533597336\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li><li class=\"xp-item\"><a class=\"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/Darkfost_Coc/status/2114016171830001763\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @Darkfost_Coc\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2114016171830001763.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig neg\">Bearish</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">derivatives</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">The weekend drop liquidated more than $840 million, nearly $700 million of it longs, across more than 228,000 traders.</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/Darkfost_Coc/status/2114016171830001763\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@Darkfost_Coc</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Oct 24</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/Darkfost_Coc/status/2114016171830001763\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li></ul><p class=\"xp-note\">Curated data-first analysts only · paraphrased, not advice</p></section>"
